&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Junior Talent Acquisition Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; - Join Our Innovative Team at thinkcell Software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Story&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At thinkcell, we create powerful software solutions that help professionals be more efficient and productive. Founded in 2002 and based in Berlin, our tools integrate seamlessly with Microsoft Office to help users create presentations, charts, and diagrams with ease. Our dynamic, international team values creativity, collaboration, and technical excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW95754275 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW95754275 BCX8&quot;&gt;We are looking for a curious and driven Junior Talent Acquisition Manager to support our technical hiring, with a strong focus on our world-class C++ Engineering team. You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW95754275 BCX8&quot;&gt;don&#39;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW95754275 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;need to have done this before at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW95754275 BCX8&quot;&gt;a high level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW95754275 BCX8&quot;&gt;, but you need to be eager to learn, creative enough to figure things out on your own, and resilient enough to keep going when the process gets tough.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW240234066 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW240234066 BCX8&quot;&gt;Support recruiting efforts for tech roles, with a growing focus on sourcing engineers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW240234066 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and hiring top-tier&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW240234066 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW240234066 BCX8&quot;&gt;C++ engineers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW240234066 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW240234066 BCX8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
